### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "nickname": "테스트유저"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

